1
00:00:00,715 --> 00:00:02,505
Argh!

2
00:00:07,138 --> 00:00:08,348
(Leonard:)Raj?

3
00:00:08,514 --> 00:00:09,894
(Leonard:)Raj?

4
00:00:10,099 --> 00:00:12,139
(Leonard:)Raj?

5
00:00:13,102 --> 00:00:14,182
(Sheldon:)I'm busy.

6
00:00:14,353 --> 00:00:15,393
(Sheldon:)Doing what?

7
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,480
(Sheldon:)-You've made your point.
-What do you want, Sheldon?

8
00:00:21,652 --> 00:00:24,862
(Sheldon:)I looked over the board,
and it turns out you were right.

9
00:00:25,031 --> 00:00:26,661
-You were wrong?
-I didn't say that.

10
00:00:26,824 --> 00:00:29,824
(Raj:)-That's the only logical inference.
-I didn't say it.

11
00:00:30,536 --> 00:00:33,826
(Sheldon:)Anyway, I would like you to come back
and work for me.

12
00:00:34,123 --> 00:00:35,873
(Raj:)For you or with you?

13
00:00:36,876 --> 00:00:40,216
(Sheldon:)In this context,
"for me" could mean "with me."

14
00:00:40,379 --> 00:00:42,219
-I have conditions.
-I reject them all.

15
00:00:42,381 --> 00:00:44,131
(Raj:)I'll take the job.

16
00:00:45,259 --> 00:00:46,889
(Raj:)See you Monday.

17
00:00:47,053 --> 00:00:49,723
(Sheldon:)-Wait. You have to drive me home.
-How did you get here?

18
00:00:49,889 --> 00:00:51,389
(Sheldon:)-I walked.
-So walk home.

19
00:00:51,557 --> 00:00:53,897
(Sheldon:)I can't. There's a big dog outside.

20
00:00:58,773 --> 00:01:02,403
(Sheldon:)We can start thinking about methods
of optimizing the detector...

21
00:01:02,568 --> 00:01:05,238
(Sheldon:)-...for 500 GeV particles.
-All right.

